due soon or overdue) -> Recent Activities (plant-wide chronological
feed) -> Quick Navigation (last, not first, per explicit guidance).
New utils/executiveDashboard.js is the sole KPI/health/attention/
upcoming aggregation layer, built entirely from existing sample data
via pure functions (a fixed 2026-07-20 reference date anchors the
"recent"/"upcoming" windows so the demo's numbers stay stable, not a
live clock). maintenanceHistory.js was refactored (behavior-preserving
— its existing tests pass unchanged) to extract shared per-type event
mappers and add buildPlantTimeline()/isOpenWorkOrderStatus(), reused
by both modules rather than duplicated. No chart library introduced;
built entirely from existing design-system MetricCard/ProgressBar/
Badge/Card/EmptyState. Wired into LTSAWorkspace.jsx as a new first tab
("Executive Dashboard") and made the default active tab, so it is now
the LTSA landing screen; Quick Navigation reuses LTSAWorkspace's
existing tab-switching state via a plain onNavigate callback prop (no
global state, no shared service introduced). No PM/CM/WO/Pump
component, page, or sample data file was modified; App.jsx itself was
not touched (only its test, since the LTSA tab's default sub-page
changed).

